Modelica TextMate grammar — vendored from https://github.com/SimplyDanny/modelica-language-vscode (MIT). Author: SimplyDanny.

Upstream commit: 54f27789e4bc9b9a24bc06e7a0768c75e15666bc
Source file:     syntaxes/modelica.tmLanguage (blob sha e158de21099473b7dfb832745e802b15cbaa0536)
License file:    LICENSE.txt (blob sha caf20cd22ec77593ea278d4332d706906ef6e602)

Modifications:
  - Converted from the upstream plist/XML `.tmLanguage` form to the equivalent
    `.tmLanguage.json` form (so it ships as `modelica.tmLanguage.json`). All
    pattern regexes, capture groups, scope names, `scopeName`
    (`source.modelica`), `name`, `fileTypes`, and `uuid` are preserved verbatim;
    XML entities (`&lt;`, `&gt;`) were decoded to their literal characters as
    required by the JSON form. No grammar rules were added, removed, or altered.
  - The companion `optimica.tmLanguage` grammar is intentionally NOT vendored;
    only the Modelica grammar is reused.

